{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_980.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"02cfe9f5324cd69b7afea7fb2a96739e3027a6e73f099270e48bd0a0e6de8d29","ja":"怖くない、怖くない、怖くない……！\nこ、このみさ～～～～ん！","zh":"不可怕，不可怕，不可怕……！\n木、木实小姐～～～～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_980.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"931dd27e953a88b21f52c017f8cc6234f1623d507981de46aa44001664f9968b","ja":"このみ姉！　ひとりで行かせて悪い……！\n大丈夫か？","zh":"木实姐！抱歉让你一个人去……  \n没事吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_980.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"736996179f1e2ebfd7dc7637d48f1de2037e1a7e9ef42d3b44e0bb048c2ecb47","ja":"……！　ふたりとも……来てくれたのね！","zh":"……！你们两个……过来了呀！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_980.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"7b7d4eb09f5ffa653722e54b25b0c2cd8ee724279b1318993b2d4d09024bb30a","ja":"は、はい。そ、それでおばけは……あれ？","zh":"是、是的。那、那么鬼怪……咦？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_980.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"82dba1e4715bc8437d856d48b9b62e49f3de064887c8e0dd75bed3891064b54c","ja":"ビュ～～","zh":"呼——","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_980.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"20a6b197b265585d6ed315089360cbe0407d511994877cf7af8a6c1ecb864680","ja":"窓が空いてたのね。風が吹いて、\n色々と飛ばされちゃったみたい。","zh":"原来窗户开着啊。风一吹，好像有不少东西被吹走了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_980.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"6a3cc3296c20551edfbf459ff304c6cb878c029e5f2d9c6122f8398130a9ad8e","ja":"そうだったんですね。\nあれっ、この段ボールから何か……。","zh":"原来是这样啊。\n咦，这个纸箱里好像有什么……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_980.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"ff5bbc83e447c9694653f56c93d656ee3df40a3c16b1f867a463e98be34c8e2e","ja":"あっ！\n『新春ビンゴ大会景品』って書いてありますぅ。","zh":"啊！\n上面写着“新春宾果大会奖品”。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_980.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"3a9959a324d39d804408eb3a5ea8960de020b6453cdb72cdcabbe29afec0ef61","ja":"そういうことか！\nまったく、●●●●プロデューサーのやつ……。","zh":"原来是这么回事！\n真是的，●●●●制作人这家伙……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_980.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"cea02f73d3cb85f461e2bd3ef237d81ca9c02ed0d0a1dff2bbf692eb78a543a2","ja":"ふふっ♪　絶対に開けちゃダメな部屋に、\n新年のお楽しみがあるなんて。","zh":"呵呵♪　绝对不可以打开的房间里，居然有新年的乐趣。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_980.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"6a94238b23975c06106cb64cfa920f9f8d40ab437b4fd72ebc9b9be5934c7416","ja":"……優しいですね、●●●●プロデューサー。\nこのことは、私たち3人の秘密ですね。","zh":"……您真温柔，●●●●制作人。\n这件事是我们3个人的秘密。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_980.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"23b2e3032ec2deba683df414925d912df0284fa54dbbc0f85035dad39b8c0644","ja":"ああ、そうだな！　ビンゴ大会当日まで\n何も知らない顔で過ごしておいてやるか。","zh":"啊，对了！那我就装作什么都不知道，安安稳稳地过到宾果大会当天吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_980.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"5dc35acc6e03a025e85b6d470e49c07dc6d8083255b971858b5666f062328876","ja":"はい。それで……ビンゴが終わった後に、\nしっかりお礼を言えたらいいな。","zh":"好的。这样的话……要是宾果结束后能好好向您道谢就好了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_980.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"efc88f0145c43b8c5005b84472941a71c2d9df0bf00f36de9027f30d50fd1e01","ja":"そうね。私たちの感謝の気持ち……\n思いっきり●●●●プロデューサーに伝えましょう。","zh":"是啊。让我们尽情地把我们的感激之情……\n传达给●●●●制作人吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_980.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"24ac341d2f65c8a30064ea4246f8b55671393684d1789e72aa2ebb57da00f8d3","ja":"小さな心遣い、いつもとっても嬉しいです♪って。","zh":"说是小小的体贴，总是让人特别开心♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
